<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n103244" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τεσσᾰρᾰκοστ-ός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fortieth</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.60
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				Dor.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τετρωκοστός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Archim.
				<u>Aren.</u>
				4.10
			</span></i>, al.; also 
				Ion.
			 apparently, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				167.17
			</span></i> (Mylasa, <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>): but 
				Ion.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τετρηκοστή</span></b>  (pr. n.) <i><span class="en">
				<u>GDI</u>
				5755.5
			</span></i> (ibid.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τεσσαρακοστή</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μοῖρα</span>): </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>tax of one-fortieth</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ec.</u>
				825
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίτροπος τεσσαρακοστῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>MAMA</u>
					4.113
				</span></i>
			 (Lysias, <span class="entity">i/ii A.D.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> a <i>fortieth</i>, a coin of Chios,
				<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				8.101
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
